  "notes": "PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt says the subnet is the corresponding /22 block, but the ground truth subnet is a /24 (172.18.0.0/24 default); the mask is not checked, only what both guarantee (the subnet lies in the default 172.18 range). Whole-range NACL TCP/UDP entries accepted as protocol 6/17 with a 0-65535 or 1-65535 port range, or one all-protocol (-1) entry. An unresolved Fn::FindInMap CIDR is accepted only when its key is the default octet 18. A Ref to a parameter resolves to its default and records no ref, so a parameter the VPC never uses cannot be detected."
